{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-sr-luji-bianwang","title":"陆机著《辨亡论》上下篇论吴之兴亡","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-df0ed47d31d23f5ecdb5","label":"裴注·陆机辨亡论","text":"陆机著《辨亡论》：上篇历数武烈、桓王、大皇帝功业与周瑜赤壁、陆公西陵之胜，讫于末叶土崩；下篇论太祖成之以德、陆公却蜀师三万据东坑、步阐之乱平而太康之役邦家颠覆，参天地人和三要素论吴兴亡之由","evidence":["santizhu-q-66f914f23efa92084329","santizhu-q-ea9539daaf69a051317b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0076","role":"著《辨亡论》上下篇","evidence":["santizhu-q-66f914f23efa92084329","santizhu-q-ea9539daaf69a051317b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu-q-66f914f23efa92084329","santizhu-q-ea9539daaf69a051317b"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-66f914f23efa92084329","source_order":[48,566,0],"order":8927}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0076","name":"陆机","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-66f914f23efa92084329","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-73e93ae08f1c77667aa0","layer":"pei","quote":"陆机著《辨亡论》，言吴之所以亡，其上篇曰：“昔汉氏失御，奸臣窃命；祸基京畿，毒遍宇内；皇纲弛紊，王室遂卑。","attribution":"裴注·陆机辨亡论","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":565,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c88fd738771fcd384c21","start":0,"end":53},{"id":"santizhu-q-ea9539daaf69a051317b","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-677dc7d7da9d0c1752e2","layer":"pei","quote":"其下篇曰：“昔三方之王也：魏人据中夏；汉氏有岷、益；吴制荆、扬，而奄交、广。","attribution":"裴注·陆机辨亡论","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":566,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c88fd738771fcd384c21","start":0,"end":38}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
